 * SpxTextsUk -- the window in Ukrainian.
 *
 * One language, one file. The order is TSpxStr's and nothing else: this is a positional
 * array, so a line moved here moves a caption on screen.
 *
 * Ukrainian is here for the same reason Belarusian and the Balkan three are: the engine
 * carries its plural rules and this product has been tested on them, so an author writing
 * Ukrainian templates can have the window in the language of the text.
 *)
